{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23733","headline":"太和戊申岁大有年诏赐百寮出城观稼谨书盛事以俟采诗 · 白居易","name":"太和戊申岁大有年诏赐百寮出城观稼谨书盛事以俟采诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清晨承诏命，丰岁阅田闾。\n膏雨抽苗足，凉风吐穗初。\n早禾黄错落，晚稻绿扶疎。\n好入诗家咏，宜令史馆书。\n散爲万姓食，堆作九年储。\n莫道如云稼，今秋云不如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23733.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23733","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}